'''Cat God''' (神さま（本気）, ''Kami-sama (Honki)'', '''God (Serious)''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy seen as the boss of [[The Big Bang (Cats of the Cosmos)|The Big Bang]] in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 2. Once his stage is cleared, his [[Cat God the Great (Special Cat)|Mythic Cat counterpart]] will be unlocked. He was added in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]].

