==Trivia==
*His pose is taken from Michelangelo's ''[[wikipedia:David (Michelangelo)|David]]'' sculpture.
*Prior to the [[Enemy Guide]] rework in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]], Cat God had a joke "trait" named Cool Dude. His name in the Enemy Guide was Cat God (Cool Dude), but this was only for flavor, as he is simply a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy. [[Final Boss Giga-God]] was also a Cool Dude.
**In [[BCJP]], Cat God still has this "trait" next to his name. The Cool Dude "trait's" Japanese name is 本気 (''Honki'', Serious); this is different from the actual Serious trait in [[Yuru-i GeGeGe no Kitarou: Youkai Dotabata Daisensou|YuruGeGe]], which was named しりあす (''Shiriasu'').

